  # Munley Law Silo Analyzer                                                                                                          
                  
  Analyzes a set of Munley Law pages for content quality issues: shared copy, structural problems, legal/factual errors, and copy
  mistakes.                               

  **Critical rule: Never modify any page. This is a read-only audit.**                                                                
                                          
  ---                                                                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                      
  ## Step 0 — Load Patterns Log               
                                                                                                                                      
  Before doing anything else, read the patterns log:
                                                                                                                                      
  ```
  /Users/nicko/.claude/skills/munley-silo-analyzer/PATTERNS.md                                                                        
  ```             
                                                                                                                                      
  If the file exists, scan the **Cross-Funnel Patterns** section. Note any confirmed patterns (marked `[CONFIRMED]`) so you can flag
