  ## Step 3 — Identify Issues                                                                                                         
                                                                                                                                      
  For each page, check for:                   
                                          
  ### Legal / Factual Errors
  - Wrong statute numbers or wrong statute for the practice area                                                                      
  - SOL answers that omit the minority tolling rule for injury cases involving minors
  - "All partners" or "all attorneys" credential claims that may not apply universally                                                
  - Unsourced statistics                      
  - Exclusivity claims ("only firm in Pennsylvania…") that can't be verified                                                          
                                                                                                                                      
  ### Munley-Specific Flags                                                                                                           
  - **Guarantee language**: "maximum compensation," "we will win," "ensure you receive," "guaranteed recovery"                        
  - **Stale firm age**: check whether "65 years" or similar age references match the current year (firm founded 1959)                 
  - **Attorney credential mismatches**: attorney credited on a page whose listed specialization doesn't match the practice area
  - **Unlinked bio blocks**: attorney bio blocks that don't link to the attorney's individual page                                    
  - **Duplicate bio blocks**: mid-page bio block identical to bottom bio block on the same page                                       
  - **Missing MCARE references**: for birth injury pages, absence of 40 P.S. § 1303.101 et seq. and 40 P.S. § 1303.513                
                                                                                                                                      
  ### Structural Issues                                                                                                               
  - Missing H1 or H1 appearing as a lower heading level                                                                               
  - Sections present on some pages but absent on others without good reason                                                           
  - Key information buried or absent                                                                                                  
  - CTAs missing or misplaced                                                                                                         
  - "Why Choose" / credential sections that don't differentiate the page from others in the silo                                      
                                                                                                                                      
  ### Copy Errors                                                                                                                     
  - Grammar, spelling, punctuation mistakes                                                                                           
  - Broken or incomplete sentences                                                                                                    
  - Awkward phrasing or unclear modifier attachment
  - Inconsistent terminology (e.g., "cesarean" vs "Cesarean" vs "C-section" used interchangeably)                                     
  - Repetitive words or phrases within a short section                                                                                
  - Vague language that weakens the firm's voice ("good lawyer," "help you")
                                                                                                                                      
