  ### Per-Page Results                                                                                                                
   
  Report on every page — parent and supporting — but apply different rules to each.                                                   
                                          
  #### Parent page
                                                                                                                                      
  The parent page is reported on for legal/factual errors, structural issues, copy errors, and Munley-specific flags. Do **not**
  include a cannibalized copy section for the parent — it is the reference point for the silo, not a page being changed for           
  cannibalization. If the parent itself contains content that supporting pages have duplicated, note those instances in each
  supporting page's cannibalized copy section instead.                                                                                
   
